# Project rules: Bolt mobile app (Expo)

- This is a mobile app built with Expo. Design for phone screens first, and keep it working on both iPhone and Android.
- Use packages that work with Expo. Ask before adding anything that needs custom native code.
- Anything inside the app is public. Secret keys stay in server functions, never in the app code.
- After each change, tell me what to tap on my phone to check it.
- Every screen that loads data shows a loading state, an empty state, and an error message.
- Ask before changing anything to do with publishing: app name, icons, bundle IDs, or store listings.
